{"id":"atlas-intro","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":2184,"height":160,"text":"**NOS Gaps / NOS · 1.43-B**\n\nVerified gaps / clustered by area. Critical red · high orange · medium yellow · low cyan. Arrows identify affected components; repeated components are local copies, not additional systems.","color":"5"},
{"id":"today-0","type":"text","x":48,"y":356,"width":640,"height":224,"text":"**Badminton workout had no calories**\n\nBody mass is unset by default; workout calories require it.\n\nVerified: G01\n[[Gaps|Gap register]] · [[Calorie trace|Source trace]]","color":"2"},
{"id":"today-1","type":"text","x":744,"y":356,"width":640,"height":224,"text":"**No per-minute movement graph for a session**\n\nAggregate motion counters do not retain the session time series needed for a graph.\n\nVerified: G06\n[[Gaps|Gap register]] · [[Calorie trace|Source trace]]","color":"2"},
{"id":"today-2","type":"text","x":1440,"y":356,"width":640,"height":224,"text":"**No basal / passive calories**\n\nNo BMR calculation or age/sex/height profile; daily energy uses steps × 0.04.\n\nVerified: G04, G05\n[[Gaps|Gap register]] · [[Calorie trace|Source trace]]","color":"2"},
{"id":"gap-G107","type":"text","x":48,"y":848,"width":640,"height":584,"text":"**G107 / Barometer history and trend reset at every reboot although SD holds the readings; STORM only on screen**\n\n`MEDIUM`\n\nImpact: Pressure trend is lost at each boot and no storm alert is ever raised.\n\nEvidence: firmware/main/ext/ext_env.c:12-13 (ring \"not persisted across reboots\"), :174 (SP_ENV emitted to the journal), :199-222. out_baro.c:221 reads only hal_env_history; COLLECTING state and the 3 h trend (have3h needs nhist>18, :252-259) depend on the ring. STORM is computed only in out_baro.c:259,386-410; no notification elsewhere.\n\nSuggested fix: Rebuild the ring from SD records and add a background alert.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-barometer, hw-strap-env, store-sd-sports\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-barometer, hw-env, store-sports-journal","color":"3"},
