{"id":"gap-G102","type":"text","x":48,"y":2888,"width":640,"height":536,"text":"**G102 / Recorder: no delete/rename/export, only 24 memos listed, minimal playback, no way off the watch**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Older recordings are unreachable and cannot be managed.\n\nEvidence: con_memo.c:110 (MEMO_MAX 24), :215-218 (extra entries dropped), :1010-1102 (no remove/rename, no long-press), :387-398 (play/pause only); ext_audio_files.inc:61-75 (mono 16-bit WAV only). No BLE or Wi-Fi route reads the folder.\n\nSuggested fix: Add paging, delete/share and playback controls.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-recorder, drv-sd\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-recorder, store-sd","color":"5"},
{"id":"gap-G102-component-0","type":"text","x":768,"y":2888,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Recorder**\nVoice memos: record 16 kHz WAV to SD (10 min…\n\nruns: UI task, only while it is the top screen (or in a transition). Recording survives leaving the screen.\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|5 gaps]]\n[[Recorder|Open note]]","color":"3"},
