{"id":"gap-G103","type":"text","x":48,"y":3520,"width":640,"height":584,"text":"**G103 / Recorder background recording does not keep display on and can only be stopped from the Recorder**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Users may think the watch is idle while it records and must return to the app to stop.\n\nEvidence: svc_memo_stop (svc.h:195) is called only from con_memo.c:578-581; scr_memo has no SCR_KEEPAWAKE (con_memo.c:1104-1105); nos_main.c:740,757 and ota.c:65-66 refuse shutdown/OTA while recording; sys_home.c:150-160 REC chip taps through to the Recorder; a RECORDING toast shows on leaving (con_memo.c:630). Documented as intended. 10-minute cap not found in con_memo.c.\n\nSuggested fix: Add a stop action on the chip/notification and a status cue.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-recorder, sys-home, svc-memo\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]","color":"5"},
{"id":"gap-G103-component-0","type":"text","x":768,"y":3520,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Recorder**\nVoice memos: record 16 kHz WAV to SD (10 min…\n\nruns: UI task, only while it is the top screen (or in a transition). Recording survives leaving the screen.\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|5 gaps]]\n[[Recorder|Open note]]","color":"3"},
