{"id":"gap-G105","type":"text","x":48,"y":4880,"width":640,"height":584,"text":"**G105 / Find Phone is optimistic and one-way: RINGING shown regardless of delivery, phone stop never seen, offline refused**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: The screen says the phone is ringing when it may not be, and keeps saying so after the phone stops.\n\nEvidence: svc.c:965-972 (svc_find_phone sets state optimistically), :150-156 (txf drops silently), :1175-1178 (inbound find is the find-watch path), :1224 (cleared only on disconnect); con_find.c:253 (compares local state, never fires), :251 (keeps display awake), :230-233 (leaving sends stop), :249 (refuses offline). No ack, no ring timeout.\n\nSuggested fix: Add acknowledgment/timeout and handle phone-side stop.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-find-phone, svc-phone-link\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-find-phone, svc-phone","color":"5"},
{"id":"gap-G105-component-0","type":"text","x":768,"y":4880,"width":400,"height":248,"text":"**Find phone**\nOne-button launcher app that sends findPhone…\n\nruns: UI task, only while it is the top screen (or in a transition).\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|4 gaps]]\n[[Find phone|Open note]]","color":"3"},
