{"id":"gap-G108","type":"text","x":48,"y":6216,"width":640,"height":560,"text":"**G108 / Jobs: init failure is silent and permanent**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: MONITOR UNAVAILABLE until reboot with no reason; background monitor data stops.\n\nEvidence: nos/background.c:117-124 (background_init returns silently on alloc failure; observer never registered), :160-163 (tick returns early), :189; caller is registry.c:70; sys_background.c:85 shows MONITOR UNAVAILABLE with no reason. Alloc is small and fails only if the PSRAM budget is exhausted at boot.\n\nSuggested fix: Log and retry init.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-jobs, eng-nos-frame\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-jobs, eng-nos","color":"5"},
{"id":"gap-G108-component-0","type":"text","x":768,"y":6216,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Jobs**\nRead-only status board for 13 background…\n\nruns: UI task, only while it is the top screen (or in a transition). Collector itself runs 1 Hz from nos_bg_tick.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|4 gaps]]\n[[Jobs|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"gap-G108-component-1","type":"text","x":1224,"y":6216,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**nos_frame_run / frame_run**\nPer-frame pipeline: input, nos_bg_tick,…\n\nruns: Called by the UI task each ON frame; 1 Hz in AOD/SENSOR; not called in OFF.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|10 gaps]]\n[[Engine and scheduling|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"gap-G109","type":"text","x":48,"y":6872,"width":640,"height":584,"text":"**G109 / Jobs: failed on-demand sensors (heart, GPS, compass) look like normal idle**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: A faulted module is indistinguishable from idle and the Heart graph is usually empty.\n\nEvidence: background.c:29-33 (on_demand jobs), :175-178 (stale on-demand module job maps to IDLE), :197 (120 s window); ext_sys.c:197-199 and the ext modules never clear presence bits (only ext_audio.c:347 does); ext_hr.c:34-35 (40 s per 10 min); HR driver errors never reach BG_ERROR. IDLE for on-demand is partly deliberate.\n\nSuggested fix: Add stale/error mapping and clear presence on failure.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-jobs, drv-ext-hal\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-jobs, hw-strap","color":"5"},
{"id":"gap-G109-component-0","type":"text","x":768,"y":6872,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Jobs**\nRead-only status board for 13 background…\n\nruns: UI task, only while it is the top screen (or in a transition). Collector itself runs 1 Hz from nos_bg_tick.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|4 gaps]]\n[[Jobs|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"gap-G109-component-1","type":"text","x":1224,"y":6872,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Strap HAL contract and presence mask**\nhal_ext_* contract shared by all strap…\n\nruns: Serviced by the ext task, wakes at most every 50 ms.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|9 gaps]]\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"gap-G110","type":"text","x":48,"y":7552,"width":640,"height":536,"text":"**G110 / Background Jobs is a read-only monitor, not a scheduler: no controls, budget or energy attribution; 2-minute RAM history**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: No central way to bound or inspect background cost.\n\nEvidence: background.h:1-2,41-48 (observability API only), :17-18 (BG_HISTORY 120, window 120 s, RAM); background.c:19-35 (metadata table, no cost field); sys_background.c:193-258 (inputs only select/switch/freeze/page). The 13 entries are monitored jobs, not 13 tasks. Missing feature, not a defect.\n\nSuggested fix: Rename to Monitor or add a real budget/scheduler.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-jobs, eng-power-states\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-jobs, eng-power","color":"5"},
{"id":"gap-G110-component-0","type":"text","x":768,"y":7552,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Jobs**\nRead-only status board for 13 background…\n\nruns: UI task, only while it is the top screen (or in a transition). Collector itself runs 1 Hz from nos_bg_tick.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|4 gaps]]\n[[Jobs|Open note]]","color":"4"},
