{"id":"gap-G111","type":"text","x":48,"y":8184,"width":640,"height":584,"text":"**G111 / Quick report writes a false event on open and defaults the label to MISSED**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Duplicate and unlabelled marks in the raw journal, mostly hidden by readers.\n\nEvidence: fit_energy.c:53-60 (sports_report with outcome -1 on open), :188 (display default MISSED, not saved), :261 (SAVE LABEL writes a second record); sports.c:196-206, :319-321,372-382 (retained records replayed into the journal at boot, no writer dedupe); readers dedupe by boot/seq (:424-427). Screen labels the first one \"UNLABELLED MARK\" (fit_energy.c:174).\n\nSuggested fix: Post only on SAVE and dedupe replay.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-energy, store-sd-sports\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-energy, store-sports-journal","color":"5"},
{"id":"gap-G111-component-0","type":"text","x":768,"y":8184,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Energy**\nDaily steps-based kcal, food and water…\n\nruns: UI task, only while it is the top screen (or in a transition). History refresh every 10 s.\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|13 gaps]]\n[[Energy|Open note]]","color":"3"},
