{"id":"gap-G143","type":"text","x":48,"y":10832,"width":640,"height":584,"text":"**G143 / Cellular polish: no contact names, five fixed replies, SENT overstates delivery, denied registration shows SEARCHING, PIN dead end, timestamps carrier time**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Limited messaging on the optional LTE strap.\n\nEvidence: con_cell.c:545-546 (5 fixed replies), :173-178 (denied registration falls to SEARCHING), :335 (SIM LOCKED: remove PIN on a phone), :682 (SENT means SMSC accepted); ext_lte.c:46 (CNMI=2,1,0,0,0, no delivery report), :213-219 (carrier timestamp), :520 (160-char cap), :156 (UCS-2 decode ASCII-only). No contact lookup. NO SIM flash on wake not checked.\n\nSuggested fix: Add contact lookup and a DENIED state.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-cellular, hw-strap-lte\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-cellular, hw-lte","color":"5"},
