{"id":"gap-G146","type":"text","x":48,"y":12800,"width":640,"height":536,"text":"**G146 / Developer/Diagnostics/Modules gaps: trace shows fault slot 0 only, test mark reports SUCCESS before write, overlays have no indicator, Unlimited fps cost, modules status inaccuracies**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Weak on-watch diagnostics.\n\nEvidence: set_developer.c:22 (diag_log_fault_get(0) only), :69-71 (SUCCESS reported right after the request). Overlay claim overstated: set_developer.c:114 lists each overlay ON/OFF. Unlimited-fps cost is inferred. set_diag.c and set_modules.c items minor and not each checked.\n\nSuggested fix: Show all slots, report real completion.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-developer-tools, app-diagnostics, sys-modules\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]","color":"5"},
