{"id":"gap-G147","type":"text","x":48,"y":13432,"width":640,"height":512,"text":"**G147 / About/Battery page gaps: hard-coded 30 fps and board name, no MAC/slot/reset reason, uptime wraps at 49.7 days**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Wrong frame-rate statement; support needs serial.\n\nEvidence: set_about.c:251 (\"466 x 466 AMOLED, 30 fps\" while NOS_FPS is 40 and fps_cap defaults to 60), :245-248 (board string correct for B), :93 (uptime from 32-bit hal_millis, wraps ~49.7 days); no MAC, OTA slot or reset-reason rows.\n\nSuggested fix: Derive from fps_cap and add identity rows.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: sys-about, sys-battery\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]","color":"5"},
