{"id":"gap-G93","type":"text","x":48,"y":18580,"width":640,"height":704,"text":"**G93 / LTE intent not restored at boot; Control Center LTE/GPS tiles, Modules and Settings disagree with the modem**\n\n`MEDIUM`\n\nImpact: Tile shows ON while the module is off; saved settings are not honoured after reboot.\n\nEvidence: sys_control.c:179,234-235 (tile reads nos_prefs.lte); con_cell.c:96,193-194 (only place prefs are applied to the modem); nos_main.c:953-962 (radio_preferences handles BLE and Wi-Fi only); ext_lte.c:302 (idle power-down), :440-452 (boot probe); set_modules.c:1377-1380 (toggle does not update the pref); out_nav.c:469,474 (overrides the GPS tile). PWRKEY polarity and Settings GPS-row refusal not checked.\n\nSuggested fix: Give toggled modules a keep-alive owner and apply saved intent in radio_preferences.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: hw-strap-lte, hw-strap-gps, sys-control-center, sys-modules, app-settings, app-cellular\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): hw-lte, hw-gps, sys-control-center, sys-modules, app-settings, app-cellular","color":"3"},
