{"id":"gap-G94","type":"text","x":48,"y":19380,"width":640,"height":584,"text":"**G94 / Cellular inbox bugs: body OK/ERROR corrupts listing, only 12 messages, stale snapshot when radio off, read state not persisted**\n\n`MEDIUM`\n\nImpact: Hidden or stale texts and read state resetting after reboot.\n\nEvidence: firmware/main/ext/ext_lte.c:178-186 (exact \"OK\"/\"ERROR\" lines tested before the body branch), :375 and :410 (ERROR switches to a CMGL form that may mark messages read), :39 and :224-225 (MAX_SMS 12, first 12 listed kept), :495 (read state in RAM only; SIM still reports REC UNREAD). Radio-off snapshot depends on the boot probe (not traced).\n\nSuggested fix: Parse by length/state not text, raise the cap and refresh on open.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-cellular, hw-strap-lte\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-cellular, hw-lte","color":"3"},
