{"id":"gap-G135","type":"text","x":48,"y":20692,"width":640,"height":584,"text":"**G135 / Connectivity polish: raw error codes, fixed IN regulatory domain, mislabelled diagnostics, hotspot without indicator, BLE accessories not persisted**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Confusing text and limited controls.\n\nEvidence: hal_esp32.c:643-678 (\"Not connected (code N)\"), :2289-2293 (country \"IN\", channels 1-13), no airplane mode, no GATT reconnect; set_connectivity.c:87-109,216,252 (diagnostics logged under fixed NETWORKS name as PENDING). No status indicator for the hotspot found; 10-minute AP timeout not checked.\n\nSuggested fix: Humanise errors and add indicators.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: sys-connectivity, drv-wifi, drv-ble\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): sys-connectivity, hw-wifi, hw-ble","color":"5"},
