{"id":"gap-G136","type":"text","x":48,"y":21372,"width":640,"height":512,"text":"**G136 / Chat (C only) UX limits: transcript hides during a turn, leaving cancels it, 2 saved turns, non-English replies show ?, Wi-Fi only**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Limited assistant behaviour on C.\n\nEvidence: con_chat.c:30 (non-ASCII becomes ?), :49-57 (transcript drawn only when idle), :183 (LAST 2 TURNS), :201 (leave cancels the turn); voice_history.h:6; nos_main.c:731-757 (shutdown_guard cancel maps to \"SAVE RECORDING FIRST\"). Other items unchecked.\n\nSuggested fix: Address per item if Chat is kept.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-chat\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]","color":"5"},
