{"id":"gap-G90","type":"text","x":48,"y":21980,"width":640,"height":536,"text":"**G90 / Wi-Fi credentials and voice key stored in plaintext on SD and NVS**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Card removal or flash dump exposes the network password.\n\nEvidence: hal_esp32.c:1987,2004,236-246 (wifi_cred_t raw ssid/pass saved as a file under /sdcard/watch/wifi with NVS fallback); voice_chat.c:524-537 (API key in voice_chat); sdkconfig:2432 and :2744 (NVS and flash encryption off); nos_main.c:1790 (ERR unknown echoes the line, only for unrecognised commands). No normal path logs the password. Needs physical access.\n\nSuggested fix: Encrypt NVS/credentials and echo only the verb token.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: drv-sd, drv-hal-store, drv-wifi\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): store-sd, store-nvs, hw-wifi","color":"5"},
{"id":"gap-G90-component-0","type":"text","x":768,"y":21980,"width":400,"height":248,"text":"**SD mount, lease and lock**\nMounts the card and hands out a mount lease…\n\nruns: board-fs retries a failed mount; leases taken per file operation.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|17 gaps]]\n[[Storage and persistence|Open note]]","color":"1"},
{"id":"gap-G90-component-1","type":"text","x":1224,"y":21980,"width":400,"height":248,"text":"**hal_store (NVS + SD routing)**\nBlob API over NVS namespace 'wos'. Only…\n\nruns: Called inline by the owner of each key (UI task or board-fs).\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|10 gaps]]\n[[Storage and persistence|Open note]]","color":"4"},
