{"id":"gap-G23","type":"text","x":48,"y":29076,"width":640,"height":680,"text":"**G23 / Strap speaker/haptic/audio presence is assumed on B; alerts are silent with no indicator and the B strap pin map is unverified**\n\n`MEDIUM`\n\nImpact: On a bare B the alarm, call ring and notifications give no buzz or sound and the UI never says so.\n\nEvidence: ext_audio.c:343 (EXT_SPEAKER set unconditionally, \"cannot be probed; default on\"); ext_haptic.c:107-109 (EXT_HAPTIC set whenever LEDC init succeeds); ext_priv.h:24-44 (strap pins: motor 16, BCLK 1, WS 2, DIN 5, SD 6); pins.h:64 BOARD_HAS_AUDIO 0; set_modules.c:167-169,229 and set_diag.c:67-69 show the parts present. Diagnostics has a user-confirm test (ST_ASK). Pin map comes from docs/strap_layout.html and is unverified on hardware.\n\nSuggested fix: Probe or user-set strap presence, show a no-feedback indicator, add screen-flash/phone fallback, verify the strap mapping on hardware.\n\nVotes: 2/2\n\nNodes: drv-ext-hal, hw-strap-audio, hw-strap-haptic, svc-alarms, sys-call, sys-notifications, app-find-phone, app-timer\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): hw-strap, hw-speaker, hw-haptic, svc-alarm, sys-call, sys-notifications, app-find-phone, app-timer","color":"3"},
