{"id":"gap-G24","type":"text","x":48,"y":30100,"width":640,"height":632,"text":"**G24 / Flash tooling does not verify board identity (B image can be flashed to C)**\n\n`MEDIUM`\n\nImpact: A wrong COM port can flash the wrong board image, relying on manual confirmation.\n\nEvidence: tools/flash_watch.py:454-468 (checkpoint accepts any NOS device answering prefs flush), :90-126 (hostcaps check has no board field; firmware reply at nos_main.c:1188 carries none), :575-582 (esptool write_flash directly); MAC checks only in --boot-recovery and --legacy-c-backup paths (:327-331, :526); tools/build.ps1:52-54 passes only --port. Needs a wrong-port mistake; a wrong image can be reflashed via USB download mode.\n\nSuggested fix: Run the board query before checkpoint and abort when the name differs from the build target.\n\nVotes: 2/2\n\nNodes: ext-host-tools, drv-ext-hal\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): eng-flash-tools, hw-strap","color":"3"},
{"id":"gap-G24-component-0","type":"text","x":768,"y":30100,"width":400,"height":248,"text":"**Host tools (flash_watch, sdsync, exports)**\nPython tools: checked flash helper…\n\nruns: Off-watch. Run by the developer on demand.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|1 gap]]\n[[Followup 5 - USB command to handler map and host protocol edge cases|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"gap-G24-component-1","type":"text","x":1224,"y":30100,"width":400,"height":248,"text":"**Strap HAL contract and presence mask**\nhal_ext_* contract shared by all strap…\n\nruns: Serviced by the ext task, wakes at most every 50 ms.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|9 gaps]]\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"gap-G82","type":"text","x":48,"y":30828,"width":640,"height":584,"text":"**G82 / Absent GPS re-probes (12.6 s UART probe) on every enable; workouts and Navigate keep enabling it**\n\n`MEDIUM`\n\nImpact: Wasted power and CPU, and a silent dimmed Use GPS or static page.\n\nEvidence: ext_gps.c:294-296 (G_ABSENT returns to G_PROBE_START when enabled), :236-262 (3 bauds x 2 rounds, about 12.6 s), :308-315. svc_track.c:106 calls hal_gps_enable(1) every frame while recording; workout.c:389,705,829,850; out_baro.c:603; out_nav.c:469,545. hal_gps_get returns 0 when absent (:319) with no absent text. Only applies with the GPS module unplugged.\n\nSuggested fix: Latch absent with back-off unless the user retries.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: hw-strap-gps, svc-track, svc-workout, app-barometer, app-navigate\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): hw-gps, svc-track, svc-workout, app-barometer, app-navigate","color":"3"},
