{"id":"gap-G133","type":"text","x":48,"y":32220,"width":640,"height":536,"text":"**G133 / Hardware/driver minor: lux uncalibrated, CSV log writes low-pass snapshot, no TE sync on B, IMU/ENV values approximate**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Approximate readings and possible tearing.\n\nEvidence: firmware/main/ext/ext_light.c:9-11,30-31,211 (lux +-30 % until calibrated); pins.h:45 (no TE routed on B; PIN_LCD_TE only on C); board.c:706-746 (CSV logs one cached IMU sample plus battery mV). Low-pass claim not checked.\n\nSuggested fix: Calibrate and document.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: hw-strap-light, hw-qmi8658-imu, task-flush\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): hw-light, hw-imu, task-display","color":"5"},
