{"id":"gap-G81","type":"text","x":48,"y":33532,"width":640,"height":632,"text":"**G81 / Strap presence is latched at boot; no hot-plug, unplug detection or rescan**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Reseating a strap needs a reboot; removed sensors show stale states.\n\nEvidence: firmware/main/ext/ext_sys.c:172-194 (hal_ext_init once, guarded by a static), :153-160 (loop calls services only); presence bits set only at init or probe (ext_env.c:120, ext_mag.c:101, ext_hr.c:324, ext_light.c:113, ext_haptic.c:109, ext_gps.c:251, ext_lte.c:359); the only clear is ext_audio.c:347. GPS re-probes once per enable (ext_gps.c:8).\n\nSuggested fix: Add a rescan command or periodic re-probe and clear presence on error.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: drv-ext-hal, app-barometer, app-compass, app-navigate, sys-modules, app-diagnostics\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): hw-strap, app-barometer, app-compass, app-navigate, sys-modules, app-diagnostics","color":"5"},
