{"id":"gap-G87","type":"text","x":48,"y":36348,"width":640,"height":584,"text":"**G87 / Diagnostics results are not persisted, timestamped or exportable**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: After closing the screen nobody can see what failed or when.\n\nEvidence: set_diag.c:88-92 (static R/T/G), :441-442 (run_start wipes), :127-155 (log_res to hal_log, untimestamped), hal_esp32.c:444-474 (32x80 RAM ring); only reader is legacy core/apps/app_sensors.c:291-302. diag_log itself is used elsewhere but not by set_diag.c. LTE and GPS are tested; no display, Wi-Fi, BLE, flash or PSRAM tests.\n\nSuggested fix: Post results to diag_log, show the last run and add the missing subsystem tests.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-diagnostics, sys-modules, store-sd-sports\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-diagnostics, sys-modules, store-sports-journal","color":"5"},
