{"id":"gap-G04","type":"text","x":48,"y":37200,"width":640,"height":632,"text":"**G04 / No passive/resting (BMR) calories; daily KCAL is steps*0.04 only (user complaint)**\n\n`MEDIUM`\n\nImpact: Reported daily burn is a fraction of real expenditure (6000 steps = 240 kcal) and cannot be compared with logged food.\n\nEvidence: nos/svc.c:46 (KCAL_STEP 0.04) and :445 (s_act.kcal = steps*KCAL_STEP) are the only daily kcal source. fit_activity.c:467 labels it plain \"KCAL\"; face_segment.c:263 uses it with a fixed 400 ring goal (:268); fit_energy.c:144 uses it as BURNED and only the footer at :156 says \"ACTIVITY CALORIES ONLY\". No BMR code anywhere.\n\nSuggested fix: Add profile-based BMR by wall-clock time, expose separate active_kcal and total_kcal, label step energy ACTIVE.\n\nVotes: 2/2\n\nNodes: svc-activity, app-activity, app-energy, face-segment, store-nos-prefs\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): svc-activity, app-activity, app-energy, face-segment, store-prefs","color":"3"},
