{"id":"gap-G05","type":"text","x":48,"y":37928,"width":640,"height":632,"text":"**G05 / No user body profile (height, weight, age, sex); stride and kcal per step fixed**\n\n`MEDIUM`\n\nImpact: Distance and calories are one-size-fits-all; weight entered once is ignored by Activity and Energy.\n\nEvidence: nos/svc.c:44-46 (STRIDE_M 0.75, KCAL_STEP 0.04), :444-445 (used in act_publish). nos/prefs.h:37 has only sports_mass_kg (0 = unset), read only at fit_workout.c:110 for the Sports MET estimate. fit_activity.c:406 and fit_energy.c:144 never see mass. No height/age/sex prefs. HR zones not found (search not exhaustive).\n\nSuggested fix: Add a Profile section (height, weight, birth year, sex) to prefs and Settings and feed stride, BMR and workout energy.\n\nVotes: 2/2\n\nNodes: store-nos-prefs, svc-activity, app-settings, app-sports\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): store-prefs, svc-activity, app-settings, app-sports","color":"3"},
