{"id":"gap-G120","type":"text","x":48,"y":41960,"width":640,"height":512,"text":"**G120 / Heart and Breathe app gaps: resting HR not drawn, page does not refresh, SpO2 caveat missing, fixed breathing pace, no reminders**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Missing expected features and a stale history page.\n\nEvidence: fit_heart.c:203,222-228 (resting computed, draw_history ~863-871 never shows it; header comment line 11 promises it), :706 and :544 (history read once per visit), :819-824 (SpO2 with no caveat; caveat only in ext_hr.c:19 comment); fit_breathe.c fixed 4/2/6 s pattern, no reminders.\n\nSuggested fix: Display resting, refresh periodically and add a live readout.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-heart-rate, app-breathe\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]","color":"5"},
