{"id":"gap-G34","type":"text","x":48,"y":44576,"width":640,"height":632,"text":"**G34 / Activity goals mostly hard-coded; two active-time definitions; stand hours and move goal unused**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Two of three rings cannot reflect user targets; ACTIVE does not match actual walking.\n\nEvidence: face_segment.c:266 (goals { step goal, 400, 30 }); svc.c:553 (active minute = >60 steps in a clock minute), :472 (steps/92 fallback); pedometer active_seconds not read by nos/; prefs.h:27 (move_goal_10 reserved, unused); svc.c:451-453 (stand_hours computed, no UI); set_settings.c:1936 (only step goal adjustable).\n\nSuggested fix: Pick one active-time source and wire move/energy goals to prefs and the UI.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-activity, face-segment, svc-activity, store-nos-prefs\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-activity, face-segment, svc-activity, store-prefs","color":"5"},
