{"id":"gap-G35","type":"text","x":48,"y":45304,"width":640,"height":536,"text":"**G35 / Energy BURN chart is a cumulative staircase; zoomed range shows the running total**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: The screen does not show how much was burned per hour or any balance.\n\nEvidence: sports.c:405-411 (bin burn = latest cumulative kcal), fit_energy.c:94-97,142-145 (header uses the max bin), :164,175 (labelled DAILY ESTIMATE, ACTIVITY CALORIES ONLY). No BMR, balance or target code. SD-history dependency not checked.\n\nSuggested fix: Plot per-bin deltas and add a BMR and balance row.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-energy, store-sd-sports\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-energy, store-sports-journal","color":"5"},
