{"id":"gap-G36","type":"text","x":48,"y":45936,"width":640,"height":560,"text":"**G36 / Stale bpm_last shown on faces and sent to the phone as live heart rate**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: An hours-old or breathing-session reading appears as the current HR and can trigger false alarm colours.\n\nEvidence: svc.c:602-605,629-632 (bpm_last never cleared or expired), :1145 (hrm sent with no age check, only when the phone requested realtime hrm, :1181); sys_home.c:473; face_split.c:76,109,127-128 (red at >=120 or <40). Only fit_heart.c:961-964 shows an \"ago\" label.\n\nSuggested fix: Gate on bpm_last_epoch age (<2 min) and show -- otherwise.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: svc-heart, face-split, sys-home, svc-phone-link, app-breathe\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): svc-heart, face-split, sys-home, svc-phone, app-breathe","color":"5"},
