{"id":"gap-G37","type":"text","x":48,"y":46592,"width":640,"height":560,"text":"**G37 / Heart history, resting and min/max are RAM only**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: LAST 24 H, resting and last reading reset on every restart; no multi-day trend.\n\nEvidence: ext_hr.c:36,61,317 (144-entry history in a PSRAM struct, never saved), :322 (first background sample 2 min after boot), BG_EVERY_MS 10 min; svc.c:72-73 (day min/max statics), :586-618 (heart_tick rebuilds from the ring every 60 s); s_as has no heart fields.\n\nSuggested fix: Persist daily HR buckets or rebuild from the SD journal.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: svc-heart, app-heart-rate, drv-ext-hal, drv-sd\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): svc-heart, app-heart-rate, hw-strap, store-sd","color":"5"},
