{"id":"gap-G10","type":"text","x":48,"y":50764,"width":640,"height":656,"text":"**G10 / Standby has no light sleep, tickless idle or wake interrupts; 20 ms polling loop**\n\n`MEDIUM`\n\nImpact: Screen-off current stays high; runtime is far below target.\n\nEvidence: nos_power.c:20,34,49,97 (light_sleep_enable=false); sdkconfig: TICKLESS_IDLE not set (:1941), FREERTOS_HZ=1000 (:1917), BT modem sleep off (:1005). PIN_IMU_INT (8) and PIN_RTC_INT (15) are defined but never used for wake. Screen-off loop in nos_main.c:2091-2130 ends in a 20 ms delay; board.c:967-1036 reads the IMU about 150 times/s. DFS to 80 MHz does exist (PM_ENABLE=y). The mA figures are not measured here.\n\nSuggested fix: IMU wake-on-motion/FIFO on GPIO8, batched step processing, slower touch polling, then auto light sleep with modem sleep.\n\nVotes: 2/2\n\nNodes: eng-power-states, hw-qmi8658-imu, hw-ft3168-touch, hw-pcf85063-rtc, task-board-sense\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): eng-power, hw-imu, hw-touch, hw-rtc, task-board-sense","color":"3"},
