{"id":"gap-G127","type":"text","x":48,"y":66388,"width":640,"height":536,"text":"**G127 / Music remote feature gaps: no seek, album, shuffle/repeat, widget skip; air gestures need an optional module**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Only a basic remote.\n\nEvidence: hal_media_seek (hal_esp32.c:1025) has no NOS caller; svc.c:1159-1163 fills album but con_music.c never shows it; no shuffle/repeat in con_music.c; gesture code is the optional APDS-9960 module (firmware/main/ext/ext_light.c). Equaliser, widget-skip and link-gate claims not checked.\n\nSuggested fix: Add seek/shuffle, hide air controls when absent.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-music, hw-strap-light, svc-phone-link\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-music, hw-light, svc-phone","color":"5"},
