{"id":"gap-G64","type":"text","x":48,"y":69716,"width":640,"height":560,"text":"**G64 / Timer, stopwatch and snooze state are RAM only and lost on reboot or power off**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: A running 25-minute timer or long stopwatch session disappears after a restart.\n\nEvidence: svc.c:76-79,88-89 (plain statics with hal_millis deadlines), :856-938 (no store call), :1117 (snooze cleared on init); only nosalarm and nosact are stored; nos_main.c:803-811 (restart/deep sleep drops RAM).\n\nSuggested fix: Checkpoint the end epoch and laps with hal_store_save_checked.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: svc-timer, app-timer, app-stopwatch, svc-alarms\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): svc-timer, app-timer, app-stopwatch, svc-alarm","color":"5"},
