{"id":"gap-G65","type":"text","x":48,"y":70412,"width":640,"height":560,"text":"**G65 / Notification store is RAM only (20 items, silent eviction); lost on reboot**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Missed messages after restart; the unread dot clears; older items vanish.\n\nEvidence: svc.c:8,10-11 (only nosalarm and nosact persisted), :206-234 (cap 20, oldest dropped with no trace), :1280-1285 (cleared at svc_init); svc.h:32. No phone resync found in gb.c (Gadgetbridge side not checked).\n\nSuggested fix: Persist a compact ring and resync unread on reconnect.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: svc-notifications, sys-notifications, face-registry\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): svc-notif, sys-notifications, face-registry","color":"5"},
