{"id":"gap-G71","type":"text","x":48,"y":74516,"width":640,"height":512,"text":"**G71 / Weather not cached across reboot; phone data disappears after 3 h instead of going stale**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: No weather after boot until a fetch or phone push.\n\nEvidence: svc.c:70,414-424 (stale flag from 1 h; after 3 h falls back to wx_from_hal); weather_service.c:20,36,159-163 (only weather_loc is persisted, forecast is RAM); svc.c:1109. No store call for forecast data.\n\nSuggested fix: Persist the last snapshot and keep it flagged stale.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: svc-weather, app-weather, drv-hal-store\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): svc-weather, app-weather, store-nvs","color":"5"},
