{"id":"gap-G114","type":"text","x":48,"y":77448,"width":640,"height":560,"text":"**G114 / Reset settings also resets time zone, face, Wi-Fi intent and sports body prefs, leaving sportstune/wake_cfg**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Resetting settings silently changes zone, face, Wi-Fi and body values.\n\nEvidence: prefs.c:134-163 (prefs_defaults memsets everything, then face=0, wifi=0, tz_min=330); set_settings.c:1754-1775 (reset_all), :487,1375 (item \"Reset settings\", pill \"TAP AGAIN TO RESET\"). sportstune and wake_cfg not checked. Label reads as a full reset.\n\nSuggested fix: Scope the reset or reset everything consistently with a clear warning.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-settings, store-nos-prefs\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-settings, store-prefs","color":"5"},
