{"id":"gap-G150","type":"text","x":48,"y":80040,"width":640,"height":584,"text":"**G150 / Settings polish: pickers commit every detent with diagnostics, step goal row/picker mismatch, prefs only partly range-checked, learn result only while open, common settings absent**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Log flood and minor confusion.\n\nEvidence: set_settings.c:1927-1945 (pick_commit logs and saves; pk_tick not opened), :596 (step goal row), pick_enter (2000 + i*500 grid), :688-695 (learn_wait polled only while open); prefs.c:165-191 (normalize covers sleep_s, sports fields, wrist_source, fps_cap, display_te only). Plus-boot backlight and LTE claims unchecked.\n\nSuggested fix: Confirm each step, clamp loaded values.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-settings, store-nos-prefs\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-settings, store-prefs","color":"5"},
{"id":"gap-G150-component-0","type":"text","x":768,"y":80040,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Settings**\n30-row preference list in six sections.…\n\nruns: UI task, only while it is the top screen (or in a transition). Prewarmed from Home on odd frames.\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|14 gaps]]\n[[Settings|Open note]]","color":"3"},
