{"id":"gap-G101-component-2","type":"text","x":1680,"y":82204,"width":400,"height":248,"text":"**Power sheet**\nLong-press sheet with battery cells, SLEEP…\n\nruns: UI task, only while it is the top screen (or in a transition). 3 s arm timeout.\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|10 gaps]]\n[[Power - screen-off screen|Open note]]","color":"3"},
{"id":"gap-G100","type":"text","x":48,"y":82884,"width":640,"height":656,"text":"**G100 / Interactive screens without keep-awake collapse to home after ~15 s (faces picker, world clock, power sheet, Sports session)**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: A live workout session drops to home mid-run and must be re-opened.\n\nEvidence: nos_main.c:2078-2085 (timeout when top screen lacks SCR_KEEPAWAKE), :705 (nos_home_now on AOD/SENSOR), prefs.c:149,159 (sleep_s=15, sensor_idle=1). No keep-awake in sys_faces.c:443-447, time_worldclock.c:280-437, sys_power.c:371 or the workout session screen (fit_workout.c:1058-1066). Recording continues. Faces/world clock/power sheet are ordinary idle behaviour; the live workout is the real gap. Timeout is configurable (5-60 s).\n\nSuggested fix: Mark the session screen keep-awake or extend the timeout while interacting.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: sys-faces, app-world-clock, sys-power, app-sports, eng-power-states\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): sys-faces, app-world-clock, sys-power, app-sports, eng-power","color":"5"},
{"id":"gap-G100-component-0","type":"text","x":768,"y":82884,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Face picker**\nFull-screen pager through the nine faces. A…\n\nruns: UI task, only while it is the top screen (or in a transition).\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|2 gaps]]\n[[Face picker|Open note]]","color":"4"},
