{"id":"gap-G137","type":"text","x":48,"y":83636,"width":640,"height":536,"text":"**G137 / Faces polish: date English-only without month, battery shown only at <=20%, unread dot has no count, AOD minimal, saved face index not an ID**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Reduced glanceability and fragile fallbacks.\n\nEvidence: faces.c:107-110 (fk_date weekday and day only), :590-593 (status shown when charging or <=20%), :552-575 (plain unread dot); ui.c:914-917; sys_faces.c:92,373 (face index stored, bounds-checked); prefs.c:381-383 (2 s debounce). SPLIT temperature, PSRAM fallbacks and tap handling not checked.\n\nSuggested fix: Targeted polish per face.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: face-registry, face-dot, face-glyph, face-life, face-matrix, face-split, face-tape, sys-faces\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]","color":"5"},
