{"id":"gap-G139","type":"text","x":48,"y":85220,"width":640,"height":488,"text":"**G139 / Face and shell odds: TAPE lamp blinks regardless of recording, GLYPH date window never uses 12 o'clock**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Misleading indicator; cosmetic.\n\nEvidence: face_tape.c:9-10,251-262 (red REC lamp blinks unconditionally, decorative); face_glyph.c:58-74 (k_at has 4 slots but slot_pick loops k<3, so slot 3 is never returned). No jumpy date effect.\n\nSuggested fix: Tie the lamp to recording and fix slot hysteresis.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: face-tape, face-glyph\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]","color":"5"},
