{"id":"gap-G140","type":"text","x":48,"y":85804,"width":640,"height":512,"text":"**G140 / Launcher/Home/Boot gaps: fixed list, no badges or long-press, last-app RAM-only, pull gestures only on face, boot not tied to readiness**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Slower navigation and no state cues.\n\nEvidence: registry.c:9-37 (28 static rows, Developer and Diagnostics at :35-36), :40-47 (s_last_app RAM only); sys_launcher.c:1013 (ignores IN_BTN_LONG); sys_home.c:1088-1095 (sheets only from the face page); sys_boot.c (209-line animation, no readiness wiring).\n\nSuggested fix: Add favourites, badges and persist the last app.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: sys-launcher, sys-home, sys-boot\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]","color":"5"},
