{"id":"gap-G97","type":"text","x":48,"y":86412,"width":640,"height":608,"text":"**G97 / Faces lack complications, tap targets and options although steps, HR, weather, next alarm are computed each frame**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Quick-glance data and shortcuts expected of a modern watch face are missing.\n\nEvidence: sys_home.c:466-487 builds steps, bpm, weather, next_alarm_min; face.h:12-27. Only inverted, segment and split read steps; only split reads bpm and weather; no face reads next_alarm_min. Four faces have no tap handler (DOT, GLYPH, LIFE, TAPE). face_accent is inert (prefs.h:21). Only a face index is saved.\n\nSuggested fix: Add complication slots and tap shortcuts, stop computing unused fields.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: face-registry, face-dot, face-glyph, face-inverted, face-life, face-matrix, face-segment, face-split, face-tape\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]","color":"5"},
