{"id":"gap-G42","type":"text","x":48,"y":91904,"width":640,"height":560,"text":"**G42 / IMU full-scale (+/-8 g, 512 dps) clips swings; saturation guard unreachable**\n\n`MEDIUM`\n\nImpact: Smash peaks clip silently and quality counters never show it.\n\nEvidence: board.c:424-425 (accel +/-8 g, gyro +/-512 dps); board_protocol.c:263-265 (4096 LSB/g, 64 LSB/dps) so max vector is ~13.9 g / ~887 dps; nos/workout_motion.c:13 rejects only >32 g or >4000 dps, so the saturation branch never runs; WORKOUT_REJECT_MOTION_SATURATED stays 0.\n\nSuggested fix: Raise full-scale for sport use and base thresholds on the configured range.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: hw-qmi8658-imu, svc-workout\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): hw-imu, svc-workout","color":"3"},
{"id":"gap-G42-component-0","type":"text","x":768,"y":91904,"width":400,"height":248,"text":"**QMI8658 IMU (0x6B)**\n6-axis accelerometer/gyro, INT on GPIO8 (not…\n\nruns: Hardware. Read about 150 times/s by board-sense, with the screen on or off.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|4 gaps]]\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]","color":"4"},
