{"id":"gap-G43","type":"text","x":48,"y":93216,"width":640,"height":560,"text":"**G43 / No link between a workout and its raw sensor data**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Raw badminton data cannot be reliably attributed to a session.\n\nEvidence: workout.c:207-211 (epoch() returns 0 when the clock is unset); workout.h:72 (started_epoch, ended_epoch only); sports.h:8-11 (no workout start/stop/sport marker); out_imu.c:184 (CSV recorder started manually); imu_rec.c:296 (CSV has utc_ms, so matching by time window works when the RTC is set).\n\nSuggested fix: Emit session start/stop records and optionally auto-start the CSV recorder.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: svc-workout, store-sd-sports, app-imu\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): svc-workout, store-sports-journal, app-imu","color":"5"},
