{"id":"gap-G44","type":"text","x":48,"y":93872,"width":640,"height":512,"text":"**G44 / Workout cannot start without a readable SD history (no RAM-only session)**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: No recording at all on a card-less or card-fault watch.\n\nEvidence: workout.c:817 (start refused when !storage.ready), :683 (ready set only after a successful load); fit_workout.c:536-556 (only RETRY offered), :299 (\"ORIGINAL SD NEEDED TO SAVE\"); tests/workout_test.c:388-392,517-520 assert it. Deliberate design.\n\nSuggested fix: Allow RAM-only sessions with an unsaved warning.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-sports, svc-workout, drv-sd\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-sports, svc-workout, store-sd","color":"5"},
