{"id":"gap-G16","type":"text","x":48,"y":96084,"width":640,"height":728,"text":"**G16 / 24 KB NVS may overflow: sportsfood ledger rewrite and other blobs near capacity (unmeasured)**\n\n`MEDIUM`\n\nImpact: Food/water save or undo may return SAVE FAILED with no explanation.\n\nEvidence: partitions.csv:5 (NVS 24 KB, about 630 usable entries). sports.c:44-45,68-69 (ledger 8200 B, ~259-262 entries, rewritten whole at :347 and :361); hal_esp32.c:231-236 routes sportsfood straight to NVS (SD does not help). ESP-IDF writes the new blob before erasing the old, so a rewrite needs about 260 free on top of 260 live. Other blobs (PHY, nosprefs mirror, nosact, voice_hist, sportsmarks etc.) add roughly 150-190+. No on-device nvs_get_stats reading recorded; the simulator reports a fixed 84/756. On failure RAM is rolled back and the UI shows SAVE FAILED (fit_energy.c:239,249). Not specific to card-absent boots.\n\nSuggested fix: Measure with the serial sd command or Settings > Modules, then move the ledger/voice_hist/nosact to SD with NVS fallback, shrink records or enlarge the partition.\n\nVotes: 2/2\n\nNodes: drv-hal-store, store-nvs-sportsfood, app-energy, svc-activity\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): store-nvs, store-ledger, app-energy, svc-activity","color":"3"},
{"id":"gap-G16-component-0","type":"text","x":768,"y":96084,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**hal_store (NVS + SD routing)**\nBlob API over NVS namespace 'wos'. Only…\n\nruns: Called inline by the owner of each key (UI task or board-fs).\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|10 gaps]]\n[[Storage and persistence|Open note]]","color":"4"},
