{"id":"gap-G59","type":"text","x":48,"y":96908,"width":640,"height":536,"text":"**G59 / Energy totals show zero when the SD query fails, though NVS holds the entries**\n\n`MEDIUM`\n\nImpact: After ENTRY SAVED the screen can show 0 EAT / 0 mL.\n\nEvidence: fit_energy.c:36-38 (refresh zeroes bins and shows HISTORY UNAVAILABLE on failure), :66-68; sports.c:444-447 (ledger already binned), :458-461 (poll returns -1 and skips the copy), :475-482,516 (failure after 3 s SD lock wait or I/O error). Failure is uncommon and labelled.\n\nSuggested fix: Fall back to the NVS ledger totals when the query fails.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: app-energy, store-nvs-sportsfood, drv-sd\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): app-energy, store-ledger, store-sd","color":"3"},
