{"id":"gap-G51","type":"text","x":48,"y":98268,"width":640,"height":608,"text":"**G51 / Other raw sensor streams (PPG, magnetometer, mic level, env) journaled to SD without disclosure or control**\n\n`LOW`\n\nImpact: Undisclosed SD writes and a persisted noise history the user cannot see or clear.\n\nEvidence: Emit sites: ext_hr.c:284,296, ext_mag.c:187,210, ext_audio.c:172-179 (about 31 records/s, dB level only), ext_env.c:174; sports.c:56 (raw types), :119-130, :215-218, :243-272 (hourly sensors.spt files). No pref gate, no clear control; only quiesce at shutdown. A diagnostics tile (background.c:26) shows counts only.\n\nSuggested fix: Gate behind a developer or per-session flag and add retention.\n\nVotes: 1/1\n\nNodes: hw-strap-hr, hw-strap-mag, hw-strap-env, app-recorder, store-sd-sports\n\n[[Gaps|Full gap register]]\nSource IDs (before rename mapping): hw-ppg, hw-mag, hw-env, app-recorder, store-sports-journal","color":"5"},
